Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.80,H_fil,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo makakatakas ka sa akin?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.80,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.40,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo makatakas ka sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.57,0:00:04.17,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Payo ko: huwag mo nang subukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:11.22,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Boss, maawa ka sa akin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:13.02,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sa bugbog, tagasunod lang talaga ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:14.42,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Si Kalbo ang nag-utos lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.43,0:00:16.83,S_fil,,0,0,0,,kagabi pumunta pa kami sa sementeryo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:17.77,S_fil,,0,0,0,,at tumagal do'n buong gabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:18.83,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Lahat ng sabi mo ginawa ko!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:21.96,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.92,S_fil,,0,0,0,,hindi pa nagsasara ang mga sugat ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:25.92,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Lumulus na ako, Boss, maawa ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.72,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Tumayo ka. May itatanong ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:30.63,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Paiwanin mo siya sa gilid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.82,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hintayin mo ako sa harap, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:36.13,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Boss, utos lang talaga ang sinusunod ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:37.07,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Po—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:39.45,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kalma lang, ilang tanong lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:41.78,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Salamat, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:43.62,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Patay na si Kalbo, 'no?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:44.80,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pa-paano mo nalaman?!
